WEBVTT

00:04:57.746 --> 00:05:00.621
And when we're in the theater,
our hearts beat as one.

00:05:01.954 --> 00:05:03.204
That's not a metaphor.

00:05:03.204 --> 00:05:06.079
Our hearts race together,
they're soothed together,

00:05:06.079 --> 00:05:08.121
we breathe together.

00:05:08.746 --> 00:05:10.163
Ay, there's the rub.

00:05:11.788 --> 00:05:15.579
Who knows when we're going to be able
to be together again in the same space,

00:05:15.579 --> 00:05:18.413
breathing in the same air,
breathing in the same experience?

00:05:19.496 --> 00:05:21.954
Who knows when we're going to want to be?

00:05:21.954 --> 00:05:24.621
We are holding our breath.

00:05:26.871 --> 00:05:30.954
Luckily, theater doesn't just
have to happen in theaters.